&lt;p&gt;In a certain code, if:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;lsquo;A * B&amp;rsquo; means &amp;lsquo;A is mother of B&amp;rsquo;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;lsquo;A &amp;times; B&amp;rsquo; means &amp;lsquo;A is husband of&amp;nbsp;B&amp;rsquo;.&lt;/p&gt;

